        {
            "title": "Humble Bundle features Ticket to Ride, Worms Reloaded",
            "date": "2013-10-31 03:00:00",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/shacknews/1045127258752011388",
            "notes": "Humble is going cross-platform again for its latest 'Humble Bundle with Android' sale. Players will be able to pay what they want for four games, all of which are available on PC, Mac, Linux, and Android, while paying more than the average to toss in <a href=\"http://www.shacknews.com/game/worms-reloaded\">Worms Reloaded</a> (along with the mobile version of <a href=\"http://www.shacknews.com/game/worms-2-armageddon\">Worms 2: Armageddon</a>) and 2004 action-RPG <a href=\"http://www.shacknews.com/game/the-bards-tale\">The Bard's Tale</a>."
        },
